### 2.2 `VS_PAGE_HISTORY` 短按 CONFIRM/NEXT/BACK 的处理（`vs_app.c:1142-1185`，在 `vs_handle_event()` 的 `VS_INPUT_SHORT` 分支里）

```c
case VS_PAGE_HISTORY:
    if (event->key == VS_KEY_CONFIRM)
      {
        struct vs_voice_request_s request;
        struct vs_history_index_s current;

        memset(&request, 0, sizeof(request));
        request.ctx = VS_VOICE_CTX_RECORD;
        if (vs_history_get_index(runtime->index, &current) == 0)
          {
            snprintf(request.record_key, sizeof(request.record_key),
                     "%s", current.record_key);
          }

        runtime->photo_context = false;
        request.request_id = vs_begin_request(runtime);
        if (vs_voice_start(&request) == 0)
          runtime->page = VS_PAGE_VOICE_LISTENING;
        else
          vs_cancel_request(runtime);
      }
    else if (event->key == VS_KEY_NEXT)
      {
        runtime->index++;
        runtime->history_blank = runtime->index >= vs_history_count();
        if (runtime->history_blank)
          {
            runtime->index = vs_history_count() - 1;
            runtime->page = VS_PAGE_HISTORY_BLANK;
          }
      }
    else if (event->key == VS_KEY_BACK)
      {
        if (runtime->index == 0)
          {
            runtime->history_blank = true;
            runtime->index = vs_history_count() - 1;
            runtime->page = VS_PAGE_HISTORY_BLANK;
          }
        else
          runtime->index--;
      }
    break;
```
- **CONFIRM**：只取出 `current.record_key`，塞进 `vs_voice_request_s.record_key`，调用 `vs_voice_start()` 发起一轮"针对该记录提问"的语音流程，成功则切到 `VS_PAGE_VOICE_LISTENING`。
- **NEXT**：`index++`；若超出 `vs_history_count()` 范围，把 `index` 收回到最后一条并切到 `VS_PAGE_HISTORY_BLANK`（"拍照提问"空白页），说明历史列表被建模成"往新方向翻到头就是空白拍照页"。
- **BACK**：`index == 0` 时同样转入 `VS_PAGE_HISTORY_BLANK`（历史列表的另一端也接到空白页），否则 `index--`。

`VS_PAGE_HISTORY_BLANK` 的 CONFIRM/NEXT/BACK 逻辑在紧接着的 `vs_app.c:1186-1237`：CONFIRM 发起 `VS_VOICE_CTX_PHOTO` 拍照问答；NEXT 把 `history_blank=false, index=0` 切回 `VS_PAGE_HISTORY`（回到最新一条）；BACK 把 `index = vs_history_count()-1` 也切回 `VS_PAGE_HISTORY`（回到最旧一条）。

